--- !u!114 &689701731
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 522044846}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ba2ac043a0776a4d846aaf6ba38a734, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Cutboard
  description: 'This is a cutting board.

    When a user grabs an ingredient and
    brings it into contact with the blue, semi-transparent box above the cutting
    board, the ingredient will be placed on the board.

    Only one ingredient can
    be on the cutting board at a time. An ingredient on the board cannot be grabbed
    again until it has been fully cut.

    Once a user grabs a fully cut ingredient,
    they can then place another uncut ingredient on the board.


    When an ingredient
    is placed on the cutting board, its parent object will be set to ''cutting board''.
    To check if an ingredient is on the cutting board, use the ''getObjectInformation''
    function to check the cutting board''s information.


    For the status of a
    specific ingredient, please refer to its documentation component.


    Only
    onions, potatoes, and eggplants can be put on cutboard.'
  type: 0
  url: 
